.go.kr) 장학금 기부장학금&gt; 푸른등대 기부장학금 소개 페이지를 참고\n\t</p>\n</ul></div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<b style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><u></u></b>\n</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n\t<b style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><u></u></b><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학생 신청 및 서류제출 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">2024. 7. 10.(수</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">) 09:00 ~ 2024. 7. 25.(목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">) 18:00</span>&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">※</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">주말 및 공휴일 포함 신청기간 내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;24</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">시간 신청 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">마감일 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span>\n</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">장학금 신청은 한국장학재단 누리집</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(www.kosaf.go.kr)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">또는 모바일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(App)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">에서 학생이 직접 신청</span>\n</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">제출서류는 장학금 신청 시작일 기준 최근&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">개월&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">이내 발급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">발급처&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;\">직인 및 페이지 전체 확인 가능한 서류 제출</span>\n</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학생 신청 관련 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">한국장학재단 상담센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(1599-2290)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">로 문의</span>\n</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">\n\t<br>\n</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">○ 중복수혜:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">’24</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">년 2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">학기 푸른등대 기부장학금은 모두 생활비 장학금으로 학자금 중복지원 범위에 포함되지 않음</span>\n</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">- 단, 푸른등대삼성기부장학금과 동일학기 중복 수혜 불가</span>\n</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><br>\n\t</span>\n</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">○&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;\">기타 자세한 사항은 한국장학재단 누리집 또는 모바일 앱 참조</span><br>\n</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">\n\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;- 누리집 경로: 장학금&gt;기부장학금&gt;푸른등대 기부장학금</span>\n</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">\n\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;- 모바일 경로: 좌측 상단 메뉴&gt;장학금&gt;푸른등대 기부장학금</span>\n</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">\n\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><br>\n\t</span>\n</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">붙임&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1. 2024</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">학기 푸른등대 기부장학사업 계획 및 업무처리기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span>\n</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2. 2024</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기 푸른등대 기부장학금 사업 요약표 1부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.&nbsp; 끝.</span><b style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><u><br>\n\t</u></b>\n</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
